{
  "_doc": "Tier-2 roadhouse on Route 9 (Pell's Crossing, lot 'tavern', front faces the highway). Route: front doors nailed shut from outside -> round the north side to the beer hatch shed -> down the hatch ladder into the keg cellar (tab book; the cellar stair boarded from above) -> up the trapdoor ladder behind the bar -> Gus's keys on the counter (taking them, or the bottle chime at the bar flap, wakes the bar room) -> unlock the kitchen behind the bar -> back hall -> stairs up -> Marnie's door (key; shotgun wired inside) -> her bedroom: the safe by the bed (loot), Marnie -> back down, unbolt the back door by the hatch. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
